    {
      "type": "Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions",
      "notes": "Directions: Blend, shake, or briskly stir the contents of one packet (58 g) into 10-12 oz chilled water and consume once daily, or as directed by your healthcare professional. Adjust amount of water to desired sweetness and thickness."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: All Other",
