      "type": "Formulation re: Does NOT Contain",
      "notes": "Formulated to exclude: Wheat, gluten, yeast, soy protein, animal and dairy products, fish, shellfish, peanuts, tree nuts, egg, sesame, ingredients derived from genetically modified organisms (GMOs), artificial colors, and artificial sweeteners."
    },
    {
      "type": "Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)",
      "notes": "Quatrefolic\r\nS1. Quatrefolic is a registered trademark of Gnosis S.p.A. produced under U.S. Patent 7,947,662.\r\nAlbion Minerals\r\nS2. Albion, DimaCal, TRAACS, and the Albion Gold Medallion are registered trademarks of Albion Laboratories, Inc.\r\nS3. Preventium is a registered trademark of Applied Food Sciences, LLC. (U.S. Patents 4,845,123, 5,364,644, 5,561,160).\r\nAminogen\r\nS4. Aminogen is a registered trademark of Innophos Nutrition, Inc. Aminogen is protected under U.S. Patent 5,387,422.\r\nCopyright 2024 XYMOGEN"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "Quatrefolic\r\nAlbion Minerals\r\nAminogen"
    },
    {
      "type": "FDA Disclaimer Statement",
      "notes": "These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."
    },
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "OptiCleanse Plus is a comprehensive nutritional formula that provides high-quality macro- and micronutrients associated with biological detoxification pathways. The formulation features 24 grams of VegaPro, a proprietary vegan pea/rice protein; Aminogen enzyme blend to facilitate protein absorption; activated B vitamins like 5-MTHF and Albion's patented mineral amino acid chelates for optimal nutrient bioavailability; and milled golden flaxseed that provides a source of omega-3 fatty acids and lignans, which may support estrogen modulation in postmenopausal women. When paired with a modified elimination diet, this formula nourishes the body's detoxification systems and fuels sustained energy production. This monk fruit-sweetened formula boasts a superior taste without added sucrose, fructose, or stevia and is suitable for vegans."
    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Vegetarian/Vegan",
      "notes": "This monk fruit-sweetened formula boasts a superior taste without added sucrose, fructose, or stevia and is suitable for vegans."
    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Does NOT Contain",
      "notes": "This monk fruit-sweetened formula boasts a superior taste without added sucrose, fructose, or stevia and is suitable for vegans."
    },
    {
